<title>BELGIUM: EU reduces beef export refunds.</title>
<headline>EU reduces beef export refunds.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union reduced beef export refunds with effect from Friday, a European Commission official said.</p>
<p>The reduction for male animals is five percent and for female animals 15 percent, the official said.</p>
<p>&quot;A notice has been put in Friday's Official Journal announcing that refunds for carcasses, cuts and live animals have been cut,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>The Commission took the decision because of the high level of applications for export licences.</p>
<p>&quot;On Monday and Tuesday licences were rejected because of the volume of applications,&quot; the official said.</p>
</text>
